{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01QTmKkgGM6JmZ1ESwUCBdQ1","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Both reviewers have completed their independent assessments. Now I need to run the full roundtable process:\n\n- Step 1: Independent reviews ✅ (done)\n- Step 2: Cross-sharing (each reviewer reads the other's review and responds)\n- Step 3: Convergence (identify agreements/disagreements, calibrate scores)\n- Step 4: Synthesize final consolidated report\n\nLet me now proceed to Step 2 — cross-sharing. I'll launch two agents in parallel: R1 reads R2's review and responds, R2 reads R1's review and responds.\n\n\nI'm reconsidering the workflow. Rather than running all steps separately, I'll have the reviewers do cross-sharing and convergence together in a single discussion where they both see each other's assessments and work toward alignment. Then I'll handle the final synthesis myself.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4460,"cache_read_input_tokens":71557,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4460},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a39f4bf6-f98d-43c7-bbf4-41a033e3e2e7","uuid":"8581b3d4-e2ca-4518-8c16-0739c2c42efe"}
